Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:29.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.58,0:00:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「着魔」的医学术语是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is the medical term for an obsession?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道吗 我觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel you see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得去安葬一个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I must lay to rest a ghost{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.97,0:01:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它跟着我有一阵子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which has haunted me for some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要出门几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be away for several weeks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.40,0:01:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去苏格兰高地\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the highlands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时 看到你在诊室的时间变长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanwhile, your patience might be encouraged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.12,0:01:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的病人也会受到鼓舞吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}by seeing you more often in your consulting room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.25,0:01:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贝克街那边怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Baker Street?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.88,0:01:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邮件存在邮局里 有第欧根尼俱乐部在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poste Restante, Diogenes Club, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.79,0:01:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切照旧 你知道我的办案方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the regulars, you know my methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会时刻关注着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be watching you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.12,0:01:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}用我的第三只眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}with my third eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:55.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}《皇冠宝石案》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.17,0:02:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}110克拉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred and ten carats, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比「希望之星」还要大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bigger than the Hope diamond, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.56,0:02:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至比「光明之山」还大\N{\fnArial\fs30}bigger even than the Koh-l-Noor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.13,0:02:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难怪法国佬那么着急想把它要回去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder the froggies are anxious to get it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有10分钟就要闭馆了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closing in 10 minutes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gerald!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.56,0:03:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我姐姐艾格尼丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my sister Agnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没看出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not perceive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.59,0:03:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们之间有明显的血缘关系吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}a strong family resemblance between us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是骨架\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the bone structure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格拉德家特有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peculiar to the Garridebs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.77,0:03:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不论男女 你没看出吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}be they male or female don't you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.87,0:03:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是艾米丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Emily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.88,0:03:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是伟大的央格鲁-撒克逊人的后裔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're descended from good Anglo-Saxon stock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}古老的血统流淌在我们的血液里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient blood courses through our veins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.77,0:03:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听到这些我很宽慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm relieved to hear it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 快请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, do, please do sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是说格拉德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say Garrideb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.69,0:03:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生 我没有再三重复的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, I'm not in the habit of repeating myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她没有再三重复的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not in the habit of repeating herself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚说过了 亲爱的艾格尼丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just said that, Agnes dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.85,0:03:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐听力不太好 你知道吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister is a little hard of hearing, don't you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.39,0:03:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我大学里有一门课程\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of my university lectures{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.92,0:03:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是由格拉德讲授的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was called Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他还记得你 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He remembers you, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是亲戚吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're related?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.48,0:03:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我们的哥哥 叫内森\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is our brother, Nathan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正是因为他我们今天才会来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the only reason for our presence here today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他病了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's ill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没有大碍 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not inordinate. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你们之中的哪位病了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, are either of you ladies ill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.92,0:04:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 啊 没有大碍 - 一点没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ah, not inordinately. - Not of any sort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自从我跟我姐姐年轻时起\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I have followed a strict regime{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就遵守着一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}of clean, healthy living{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}规律健康的生活习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}since we were young girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲不允许的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father wouldn't allow it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我们要求我们所有的先生们都照做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we insist that all our gentlemen do the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.67,0:04:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们的先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.96,0:04:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的房客先生 华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our gentlemen tenants, Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.27,0:04:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 明白了 你们出租房子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see you rent rooms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是随便租给任何人的 你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to anybody, you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.43,0:04:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐和我对于与我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I are most particular{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.97,0:04:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同住一个屋檐下的人很挑剔\N{\fnArial\fs30}about who we have under our roof, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.30,0:04:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难道不是吗 艾米丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't that so, Emily?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't quite follow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果没人生病\N{\fnArial\fs30}if no one is ill, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.94,0:04:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你们为什么来见我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why do you come to see me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为这很显然啊 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was obvious, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.61,0:04:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有案子要找夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a case for Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特莫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cantlemere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在第欧根尼俱乐部很少见到你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't often see you here at the Diogenes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你依照要求跟你弟弟谈过了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you spoken to your brother as requested?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必我提醒你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't need to remind you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁发出的要求吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}from whence the request came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.92,0:05:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是首相先生的私人愿望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the Prime Minister's personal wish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.42,0:05:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你的弟弟能够运用他的侦查技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your brother should employ his detective skills, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到马萨林钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}find the Mazarin diamond{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后按时返还给白厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}and return it to White Hall without delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我恐怕夏洛克现在没空\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm rather afraid Sherlock's unavailable at the present time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没空？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unavailable?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实在有点为难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inconvenient I know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他正在苏格兰着手另一件案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's engaged in another case up in the highlands, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约一周内都回不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't expect to be back for about a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.29,0:05:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样不行 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good enough Mycroft, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须\N{\fnArial\fs30}you really must try{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你弟弟赶回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keep your brother on a shorter leash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.11,0:06:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道马萨林钻石的历史吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know the history of the Mazarin Diamond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.57,0:06:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道 我当然知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course I do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是以路易十四时代的首席部长\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was named after Cardinal Jules Mazarin, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红衣主教朱勒 马萨林命名的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a Chief Minister during the reign of Louis the XIV, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在属于女王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}it belongs now to Majesty of the Queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 但马上就要被归还给法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but it is soon to be returned to France{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为英国人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it belongs as a goodwill gesture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}友好的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the part of the British people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.00,0:06:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你也同意这样的象征\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think you'll agree that such a gesture{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定会巩固\N{\fnArial\fs30}can only help to cement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.10,0:06:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们两国之间的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}the relationship between our two countries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.64,0:06:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们现在食言\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go back on our word now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将会招致外交危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}could spell diplomatic disaster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.65,0:06:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首相请求你弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Prime Minister has asked that your brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.89,0:06:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来调查这个案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}investigate this case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.59,0:06:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且福尔摩斯先生 从未让他失望过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Mr. Holmes has never, ever let him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我亲爱的霍雷肖\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Horatio, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.58,0:06:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果夏洛克在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}if Sherlock were here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.15,0:06:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定他绝对十分乐意效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he'd be more than delighted to assist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.11,0:06:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少 我想他会帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, I think he would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你看他并不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's not here you see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以他无法效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he can't, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I could, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}illuminate me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他昨天来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came to the house yesterday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.91,0:07:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个美国人到你家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}An American came to your house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜访你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}to visit your brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.36,0:07:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后要给他很多钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and offered him a large sum of money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five million dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五百万美元？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five million dollars?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.53,0:07:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三个人平分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteen million dollars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一千五百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be divided between three people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要是姓格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the same name, Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但只有姓格拉德的男人能分到财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only male Garridebs can share the fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.10,0:07:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有那个美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the American.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但显而易见 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's as plain as a pikestaff, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他根本就不姓格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a real Garrideb at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说他姓这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he says he is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.10,0:07:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们不信 对吧 艾米丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we know otherwise, don't we, Emily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.19,0:07:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凭什么不信？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do, how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骨架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bone structure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.81,0:07:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他就没有这种骨架\N{\fnArial\fs30}He simply doesn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.37,0:07:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.59,0:07:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.44,0:07:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骨架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bone structure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:08:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论是谁干的 那人绝对是个恶棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever it is, the man's an absolute cad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特 想想国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, think of the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.01,0:08:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想象一下如果找不到马萨林钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine if the Mazarin Diamond was never found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者再被发现时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or turns up again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.68,0:08:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它已变成别的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a variety of different shapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.27,0:08:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 女士们 失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, ladies, if you'll excuse me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有病人等着我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are patients waiting to be seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们的名片 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is our card, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.89,0:08:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会为我们伸张正义\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will speak on our behalf, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 医生？拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}won't you, Doctor, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会尽力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do what I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five million dollars, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.39,0:08:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您的倾听 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you for listening, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.10,0:08:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 艾格尼丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, Agnes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没有我原想的那么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not as intelligent as I thought he'd be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格拉德这个姓氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The name Garrideb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许对你们来说毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}will almost certainly mean nothing to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我觉得我应该一一道明\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I feel I should relay the particulars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这桩神奇案件里的特别之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a most extraordinary tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钻石被窃之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long had the diamond been exhibited{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}展出了多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}before its theft?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.15,0:08:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约10年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly 10 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:08:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在同一个玻璃橱中？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside the same glass case?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.73,0:09:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, as far as we know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个锁被换过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has this lock ever been changed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.11,0:09:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个大门都被换过 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole gate would have to be replaced, Mr. Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本无机可乘\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing was left to chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.20,0:09:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}督察 无论谁来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector, whoever took the diamond{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毫不费力地\N{\fnArial\fs30}was able to walk in here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁取走了钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}without any apparent difficulty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.88,0:09:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于锁上没有任何印记或刮痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}since there were no marks or scratches on the lock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然不是强行取走\N{\fnArial\fs30}to suggest it was forced, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我们可以得出结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}we may safely conclude{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盗贼有钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the thief had a key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once inside, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能够轻而易举的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would've been the work of a moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.76,0:09:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敲碎容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}to smash the case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}取走宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}and remove the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你不知道失窃案发生的确切时间 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gather you were unconscious at the time of the theft, is that correct?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.65,0:10:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.24,0:10:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他袭击我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was just seeing out the last of the public{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.44,0:10:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时正要送走最后一批访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}and getting ready to lock up for the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.60,0:10:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并准备上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he came at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.78,0:10:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到他了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.49,0:10:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我要转身之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I could turn around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他猛击了我 我就倒下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he clobbered me and I went down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.83,0:10:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你似乎很肯定袭击者是位男性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seem confident that your attacker was a male{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且是单独行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}who acted alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.99,0:10:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我是这样猜想的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I suppose so, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我无法断言\N{\fnArial\fs30}although I couldn't swear to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.21,0:10:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据我所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I knew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.26,0:10:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵走后 博物馆空无一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the count had gone and the museum was empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.27,0:10:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.28,0:10:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西尔维厄斯伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count Sylvius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是袭击发生前 最后一位离开大楼的访客\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the last member of the public to leave the building before the attack happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.37,0:10:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内格雷托 西尔维厄斯伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count Negreto Sylvius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们跟他谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've spoken to him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.05,0:10:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他不记得看到任何异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}he remembers seeing nothing untoward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他肯定这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且部长亲自要求我不要查这条线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Commissioner himself has asked me not to pursue that line of inquiry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.35,0:10:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵很幸运 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}count was lucky, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果再多留一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he strayed any longer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.98,0:10:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他可能也会遭到袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}he might've got clobbered as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.93,0:11:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他来了 内森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is Nathan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.36,0:11:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 他没来 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he hasn't has he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小沃特金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Young Watkins, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.74,0:11:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴这么多年后再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}nice to see you after all these years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.38,0:11:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用管我们 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay no regard, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.54,0:11:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐 请坐 小沃特金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sit you down, sit you down, young Watkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.91,0:11:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}家族的物种 蝙蝠\N{\fnArial\fs30}A species of the family, vespertilionidae.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.29,0:11:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是在年轻时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found him in a subterranean cavern{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去非洲东南部的索法拉旅行时\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my travels in Sofala in Southeast Africa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.99,0:11:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在一个地下洞穴里发现他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my younger days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在当然不常出门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get out much now of course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.99,0:11:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老胳膊老腿不如当年啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}hands and legs aren't what they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.05,0:12:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生是代表夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson is acting for Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.18,0:12:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是要来跟你谈谈那位格拉德先生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's come to talk about the other Mr. Garrideb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.86,0:12:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是你那老胳膊老腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}not your hands and legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there it is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉他那个美国人跟我们说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell him what the American told us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.13,0:12:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的访客先是解释说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our visitor started by explaining{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何来自于美国堪萨斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that anyone from Kansas in the United States of America{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.81,0:12:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都会认得这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}would recognize the name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亚历山大 汉密尔顿 格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexander Hamilton Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没有任何亲戚或家属\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had no kith nor kin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.13,0:12:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他以自己姓氏的独特为自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he took a kind of pride in the queerness of the name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.33,0:12:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因为此 我们走到了一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's what brought us together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.76,0:12:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天 一位老者拜访了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day I had a visit from the old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为能够找到同姓的人 而兴奋不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was tickled to death to find someone else with the same name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.41,0:12:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是决定要找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dead set on finding out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.71,0:12:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}世界上还有没有其他姓格拉德的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there were any other Garridebs in the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.01,0:12:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}于是他请我再去找到一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he asked me to find him another.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I was a busy man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能花时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and couldn't spend my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周游世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiking around the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寻找其他姓格拉德的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in search of other Garridebs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.65,0:12:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但在他死后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when he died{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是一年后\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a year later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.20,0:12:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他留下了堪萨斯州记录在案的 最为诡异的遗嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he left behind the queerest will ever filed in the state of Kansas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.65,0:13:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他把他的财产分为三份\N{\fnArial\fs30}His property was divided into three parts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.09,0:13:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中我得到一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}of which I was to have one, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要\N{\fnArial\fs30}on condition{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.69,0:13:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再找到两位格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I found two Garridebs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们将平分剩下的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}who would share the remainder, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每人五百万美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}five million dollars each if it's a cent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.98,0:13:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但除非我们三人齐聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can't lay a finger on it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我们无法染指财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we all three stand in a row.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.27,0:13:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我完全不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe a word of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 整个美国都没有这个姓氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there isn't one in the whole of the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.17,0:13:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我仔仔细细调查过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went through it with a fine-tooth comb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.84,0:13:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我也联系不到任何一位格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}and never a Garrideb could I catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我决定到这片故土试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I decided to try the old country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.38,0:13:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果然\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sure enough, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伦敦电话号码簿上有你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was your name in the London telephone directory, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三位成年男子 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three adult men sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.14,0:13:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这正是亚历山大 汉密尔顿 格拉德的遗嘱里指定的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it specified in Alexander Hamilton Garrideb's will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已有两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two down, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只差一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}one to go, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五百万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}five million dollars, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.93,0:14:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}hallelujah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}空前的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unparalleled good fortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.04,0:14:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女性亲属不够资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Female relatives are disqualified, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个世界上肯定还有 其他姓格拉德的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}surely there must be some other Garridebs in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.48,0:14:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么看？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.97,0:14:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你相信这个人的故事吗 格拉德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, do you believe this man's story, Mr. Garrideb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 毫无疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, without a doubt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.64,0:14:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看起来很诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had an honest face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 真的吗 那人就是个无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, really, the man's a rogue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.43,0:14:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的妹妹们有不同意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sisters think otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米丽和艾格尼丝读了 太多不切实际的小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emily and Agnes are inclined to read too much romantic fiction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.21,0:14:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总要在本应光明的地方寻找阴影\N{\fnArial\fs30}and inclined to find shadows where there should only be light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.28,0:14:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你的讲述 格拉德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well thank you for explaining Mr. Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.46,0:14:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴再次见到你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a great pleasure to see you again, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内森 你真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nathan, oh you're so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只要得出自己的结论就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well you'll just have to draw your own conclusions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}If as seems probable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美国的格拉德看起来像是恶棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}this American Garrideb is a rogue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你们早就会跟他撇清关系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you may already have seen the last of him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但如果事情再有发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}but please, please let me know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请务必 务必告知我\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there are any further developments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we shall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.66,0:15:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.23,0:15:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再会吧 小沃特金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good day, to you then, young Watkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poppycock and balderdash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.91,0:15:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只消想想我用五百万美金 能够做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think what I could do with five million dollars, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拥有这整个国家 财富的核心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the nucleus of a national collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会是这个时代的哈里斯 斯隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be the Harris Sloan of my age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.35,0:15:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.51,0:16:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先是警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}first the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在又是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是来看我把马萨林宝石藏在哪儿的吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come to find where I am hiding the Mazarin stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.83,0:16:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可没料到你会承认 伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't expect a confession, count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你不会失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you won't be disappointed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, if you wish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.30,0:16:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是微力扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a hair trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.71,0:16:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是来自\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were a gift{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.12,0:16:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔士王妃的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Princess of Wales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此的协调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such balance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.78,0:16:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此的工艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}such workmanship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.04,0:16:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此美好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beautiful thing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却奇怪地落入错误的人手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's strangely in the wrong hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 她真是美轮美奂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, she is extraordinarily beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.02,0:16:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The diamond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.19,0:16:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.02,0:16:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得说我很惊讶之前没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must say I'm surprised no one has been tempted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.78,0:17:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}试图把她从白厅偷走\N{\fnArial\fs30}to steal her away from Whitehall before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.53,0:17:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信诱惑一直都在 伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the temptation was there, count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是缺少胆量和机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that was lacking was audacity and opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胆量和机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, audacity and opportunity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.43,0:17:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and motive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好财与贪婪就是动机 伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Avariciousness and greed are motives, count, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确信你对这不陌生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you're familiar with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.96,0:17:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}警察十分相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police are satisfied{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.07,0:17:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盗窃发生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was away from the building{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在大楼之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the theft occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接受事实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Que sera sera.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会循着自己的线索调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm following my own line of inquiry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.17,0:17:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像明尼 沃伦德夫控告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}as my brother did with Miss Minny Warrendove{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.67,0:17:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷了她的珠宝时 我弟弟做的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}when she accused you of stealing her jewels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问心无愧\N{\fnArial\fs30}My conscience is clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.11,0:17:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}*我们的过去是无法分隔的二重体 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our past is an unresolved dual Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:18:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许你对我怀有私人恩怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may hold some personal grievance against me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.86,0:18:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那并不会赋予你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that gives you no right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.42,0:18:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玷污我名誉的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sully my good name and reputation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.55,0:18:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们之间的事 伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is between us, count, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 原谅我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh do forgive me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是微力扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a hair trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.21,0:18:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}需要我等着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I wait?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no that won't be necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我同意五百万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree that five million dollars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是无法想象的慷慨数额\N{\fnArial\fs30}is an impossibly generous offer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了我过去的导师\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the sake of my old tutor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.23,0:19:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望这不会被证明是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it doesn't prove to be false.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.52,0:19:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉打扰你 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to disturb you, Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.72,0:19:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有位格拉德先生要见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a Mr. Garrideb to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太 让他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson, show him in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我以为是别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, I was expecting someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.43,0:19:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为是内森 格拉德吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Nathan Garrideb I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定是沃特金斯医生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be, Dr. Watkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.64,0:19:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能为你做些什么 格拉德先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you Mr. Garrideb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.44,0:19:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先 你可以停止干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a start you can stop interfering in matters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.90,0:19:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全与你无关的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that don't rightly concern you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.34,0:19:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.18,0:20:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我今天见了那位老人和他的妹妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the old man and his sisters today{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们告诉我 你是代表夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they told me you were acting on behalf of Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是针对你个人 格拉德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no reflection on you, Mr. Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生和我能够从\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Holmes and I have means of getting information, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.07,0:20:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其他民众无法获取的渠道得到信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is not normally available to the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.32,0:20:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想警方插手私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want the police butting into private matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但肯定的是 我们越早找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}But surely the sooner we find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.60,0:20:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三位格拉德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}a third male Garrideb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.94,0:20:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对所有人都越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}the better for all concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.34,0:20:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that puts it different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.39,0:20:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你是乐于帮忙找到第三人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're content to help us find the third man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.47,0:20:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我看不出有任何害处\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I can't see any harm in that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望这样能让你安心 格拉德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I put your mind at rest, Mr. Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Garrideb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我刚才对你有任何唐突 那很抱歉 沃特金斯医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry if I was a bit short with you back there, Dr. Watkins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫我华生就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, it's quite all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对这个国家完全不熟悉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fairly new to this country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还没适应你们英国人的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}and haven't gotten used to your English ways yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想对你这样 温文尔雅而又单纯的人来讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I must seem impatient to a man like yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.37,0:20:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定看起来很没耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}urbane and unsophisticated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.69,0:21:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你的搜寻顺利 格拉德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with your search, Mr. Garrideb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.65,0:21:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我发现任何有用的消息 我会通知你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be in touch if I discover anything useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.76,0:21:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万分感激 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much obliged, Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万分感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}much obliged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 格拉德穿着一件英国的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Garrideb has an English coat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.32,0:21:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肘部和裤子上有磨损\N{\fnArial\fs30}frayed at the elbow and trousers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}膝部有松弛下垂 说明至少穿了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}bagged at the knees with at least a year's wear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管他那么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite what he says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.79,0:21:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我打赌他不是刚刚来到这个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wager that he hasn't just arrived in this country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.93,0:21:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该不会拒绝与\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would hardly refuse to trade{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手里有质量上乘的钻石的人 做交易吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with someone who possessed a diamond of exceptional quality?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.39,0:21:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看情况 迈克罗夫特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That depends Mr. Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.34,0:21:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看什么情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, on what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是钻石的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The providence of the diamond of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的合法性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's legality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.77,0:21:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪怕是由社会上一名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it were brought to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受尊敬的人士拿来的也是如此？\N{\fnArial\fs30}by a respectable member of society?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.92,0:21:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即便女王陛下拿她的王冠来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her majesty could offer me the crown jewels{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也一样拒绝与她交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd still refuse to do business with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难以想像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strange to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些结晶的碳块\N{\fnArial\fs30}that pieces of crystallized carbon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够成为人类巨大幸福与灾祸的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}could be the cause of such great human happiness and tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.28,0:22:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有些事最好在私下讲 迈克罗夫特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things are better said in private, Mr. Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.46,0:22:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你了解吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想我们都很了解对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we understand each other, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.56,0:22:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有一份声誉很好的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have a reputable business, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.44,0:22:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法承受错误的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't afford to make mistakes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lakhime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人拿来过钻石？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were offered a diamond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当然很感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was interested of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.98,0:22:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他愿意付一大笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was willing to pay a lot of money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.71,0:22:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.89,0:22:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.41,0:22:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}西尔维厄斯伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}count Sylvius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.68,0:23:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样我不能接受艾奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, well that's no good to me, Ikey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.26,0:23:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我两天内要货\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need them within two days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.52,0:23:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对无意冒犯 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the greatest respect, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有罗杰 普拉斯伯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}only Roger Presbury{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.88,0:23:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够在一周内切割好您的钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}could've cut your diamond in less than a week{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他把他的手艺带进坟墓里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he took his skills with him to the grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我最好在还有时间的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I better find someone alive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.37,0:23:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找个活人把这活儿给干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to do the work while there is still time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还能找谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.43,0:23:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁是罗杰 普拉斯伯利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was Roger Presbury?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 一个真正的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, a true genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.85,0:23:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个没有生命 毫不成形的石头在他手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In his hands a lifeless, shapeless stone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.95,0:23:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够变成活生生的能够呼吸的艺术品\N{\fnArial\fs30}became a living, breathing work of art.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.41,0:23:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钻石就是他的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diamonds were his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.09,0:23:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他也因此而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.73,0:23:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确 五年前他在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, he was murdered five years ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.78,0:23:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一次有关宝石的争吵中被谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}during a quarrel about some gems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.05,0:23:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此的惨剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, such a tragedy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.17,0:23:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看到伯爵的钻石了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the count's diamond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.62,0:23:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哎呀 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alas, no, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他给我描述了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he did give me a description of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.29,0:23:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他描述的是圆形的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}He described a round stone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.26,0:23:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有着最上乘的纯度与颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}of finest purity and color, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:24:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约重100克拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}approximately 100 carats in weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.49,0:24:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是110 迈克罗夫特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hundred and ten, Mr. Mycroft, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.04,0:24:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}未免与马萨林宝石的特征\N{\fnArial\fs30}but a little too close for comfort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也太相近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a description of the Mazarin stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.65,0:24:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经耽误你太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've taken up enough of your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.22,0:24:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全没有 迈克罗夫特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all Mr. Mycroft, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.07,0:24:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}完全没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.64,0:24:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人们 我有新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, I've got news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.95,0:24:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人们 告诉你哥哥我有好消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies, tell your brother I've got good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.96,0:24:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对于伯爵的厌恶是众所周知的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your antipathy for the count is well known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.84,0:24:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但个中缘由却不为人知\N{\fnArial\fs30}unlike your reasons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.45,0:24:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他让我们社会上层阶级\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brings the higher echelons of our society{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.61,0:24:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}丧失名誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}into disrepute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.04,0:24:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你的个人观点\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.83,0:24:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 我想你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I suppose you realize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.21,0:24:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明早圣詹姆斯宫接见的宾客中\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the count is among the guests at a levee{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.89,0:24:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵的名字在列\N{\fnArial\fs30}at St James's Palace tomorrow morning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应该被送进监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha, he should be serving a prison sentence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.70,0:25:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威尔士王子与王妃\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Prince and Princess of Wales{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.57,0:25:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不太可能款待犯罪嫌疑人 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}are unlikely to entertain suspected criminals, are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drive on, George.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.82,0:25:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enchanting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.12,0:25:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是个无可救药的奉承者 西尔维厄斯伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are an incorrigible flatterer, count Sylvius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.25,0:25:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果伯蒂知道你如此关注 他会非常心烦意乱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bertie would be most disturbed if he knew of your attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.97,0:25:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您最谦卑的奴仆 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your most humble servant, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}美好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A beautiful thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.88,0:26:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却落入错误的人手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}fits strangely in the wrong hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.81,0:26:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.60,0:26:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍华德 格拉德农业机械制造商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard Garrideb constructor of agriculture machinery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.88,0:26:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}捆扎机 收割机 蒸汽及人力犁耕机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Binders, reapers, steam and hand plows, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.81,0:26:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钻头 耙\N{\fnArial\fs30}drills, harrows, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.20,0:26:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}农用车 四轮马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}farmer's carts, buckboards, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.38,0:27:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}及其他设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all other appliances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.15,0:27:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}钻井评估\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estimates for artesian wells, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.55,0:27:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}位于阿斯顿的格鲁纳大楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}apply Grovner Buildings Aston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.43,0:27:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 内森 现在是霍华德\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, Nathan and now Howard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.85,0:27:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第三个格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The third Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.14,0:27:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 再读一遍广告 医生 - 注意拼写\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Read the advertisement again, Doctor. - And look at the spelling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.96,0:27:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}霍华德 格拉德农业机械制造商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howard Garrideb, constructor of agriculture machinery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.75,0:27:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}捆扎机 收割机 蒸汽及人力犁耕机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Binders, reapers, steam and hand plows, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.42,0:27:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是怎么拼“犁耕”这个词的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you spell plows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.97,0:27:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}P-L-O-W-S 哦 这是美式拼写（英国拼作PLOUGH）\N{\fnArial\fs30}P-l-o-w-s, oh, it's American spelling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.55,0:27:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能是印刷错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it could be a printer's error.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.55,0:27:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 四轮马车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, buckboards, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.83,0:27:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯明翰的钻井\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artesian wells in Birmingham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.91,0:27:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 你是在暗指\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're implying{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.58,0:27:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个广告\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this advertisement{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.75,0:27:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是由美国人写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been written by an American{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.13,0:27:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 格拉德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Garrideb?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.19,0:27:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是说霍华德 格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this Howard Garrideb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.84,0:27:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}压根就不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}simply doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.70,0:27:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且他要内森明晚在伯明翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet he asked Nathan to meet him in his office{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.44,0:27:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他的办公室里单独见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}alone tomorrow night in Birmingham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.93,0:28:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有问题 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now something is wrong, Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.52,0:28:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}terribly wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.54,0:28:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}内格雷托 西尔维厄斯伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}count Negreto Sylvius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.69,0:28:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}射击选手 运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}game shot, sportsman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}常出入社交场所\N{\fnArial\fs30}man about town, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.02,0:28:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}骗子 无赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}confidence trickster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.83,0:28:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 先生 麻烦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, sir, would…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.64,0:28:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.57,0:28:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在是钻石偷窃者\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now diamond thief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.54,0:28:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会逮到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.01,0:28:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会逮到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.21,0:28:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't go in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.85,0:28:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite all right, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.79,0:28:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.05,0:28:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}料到伯爵会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The count is expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.45,0:28:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你早该跟我说一声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you might have warned me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.87,0:28:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（马萨林宝石仍然下落不明）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.44,0:28:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要私下与这个人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk to this man in private.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.73,0:28:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用走 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.90,0:29:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是想方设法来惹恼我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have gone out of your way to annoy me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.68,0:29:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你派你的爪牙跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have set your creatures upon my track.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.82,0:29:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的爪牙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My creatures?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.04,0:29:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟你保证 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两天前是位出租马车车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago it was a cabman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.24,0:29:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天是宫殿里一个白痴老头\N{\fnArial\fs30}today some booming old fool at the palace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.49,0:29:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给予我的乔装太多赞美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give my little impersonations too much praise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.04,0:29:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.70,0:29:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你承认你一直纠缠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you admit that you have dogged me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.07,0:29:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.77,0:29:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要马萨林宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the Mazarin stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.70,0:29:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是来打探我知道多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come here to find out how much I know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.00,0:29:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及看看是否有必要除掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how far my removal is absolutely essential{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.84,0:29:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我知道所有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.42,0:29:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}except one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.57,0:29:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在你要告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you are now about to tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.47,0:29:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马萨林宝石在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Mazarin stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.55,0:29:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how in the devil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.96,0:30:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉你她在哪儿呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}should I be able to tell you where she is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.72,0:30:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道这个笔记本里记载着什么吗 伯爵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what's kept in this notebook, count?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.00,0:30:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于你 都在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you're all here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.16,0:30:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可鄙而危险的生命中的每一件勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}every action of your vile and dangerous life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.16,0:30:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道的 你手里什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you'll make nothing of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.12,0:30:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是里维埃拉头等火车上抢劫的记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here is the robbery on the Tran De Lucs to the Riviera{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.45,0:30:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而这里 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}and here oh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.33,0:30:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同一年 伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same year, count, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.99,0:30:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里昂信贷的伪造支票案\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the forged check to the Credit Lyonnais.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.25,0:30:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 这个你说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you are wrong there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.18,0:30:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那关于其他的我都说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm right on the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.53,0:30:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯爵 是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now count, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.24,0:30:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个玩牌的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are a card player, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.76,0:30:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当对方掌握着所有的王牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the other fellow has all trumps{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.51,0:30:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弃牌投降比较省时\N{\fnArial\fs30}it saves time to put down one's hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.03,0:30:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些跟马萨林宝石有什么关系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What has all this to do with the Mazarin stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.27,0:31:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找到载你去白厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the cabby who took it to Whitehall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.75,0:31:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又载你离开的车夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}and brought you away again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.79,0:31:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找到看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the attendant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.42,0:31:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}审视珠宝盒的侍从\N{\fnArial\fs30}who saw you looking over the jewel case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.55,0:31:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我找到拒绝为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the jeweler{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.90,0:31:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}切割宝石的宝石商\N{\fnArial\fs30}who refused to cut the stone up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.77,0:31:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我手里的牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the hand I play from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.54,0:31:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但还缺少一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one card is missing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.74,0:31:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}方块Q（钻石）\N{\fnArial\fs30}the queen of diamonds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你坚信她在我手里 那你是浪费时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting time if you believe I have her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.11,0:31:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果对你来说是消遣 那就继续纠缠我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue to dog me if it amuses you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.93,0:31:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对我来说可不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}it don't amuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.44,0:31:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但记得 微力扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}But remember, hair trigger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.86,0:31:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他打算怎么处置钻石？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can he hoped to dispose of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.45,0:31:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珠宝商说要花数周\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jeweler said it would take weeks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}才能切割好钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cut up the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.16,0:31:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只有个叫普拉斯伯利的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a man called Presbury{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.44,0:31:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够更快完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}could do it in less time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.66,0:32:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.18,0:32:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过杀了他的人可能还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the man who killed him may still be alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.04,0:32:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他提到微力扳机是什么用意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does he mean by hair trigger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.72,0:32:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在暗示我会死于非命\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means I won't die in my bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.56,0:32:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些是罗杰 普拉斯伯利的验尸照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are postmortem photographs of Roger Presbury, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.69,0:32:50.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕很令人不快\N{\fnArial\fs30}rather unpleasant, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.16,0:32:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定很习惯于这种景象 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be used to such sights, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.27,0:32:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 是的 的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.44,0:32:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于他的谋杀你还能告诉我们什么 督察？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what can you tell us of his murderer, Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.44,0:32:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个叫温特的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man called Winter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这儿有他的照片 来自我们的罪犯图库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got his photograph here in our rogue's gallery somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.41,0:33:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因过失杀人罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found guilty of manslaughter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.25,0:33:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}判处五年监禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}sentenced to five years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.03,0:33:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 两个月前被释放了\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, released two months ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.93,0:33:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是他 芝加哥人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is, a native of Chicago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.38,0:33:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹姆士 温特\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Winter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.83,0:33:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}化名莫尔克劳福特\N{\fnArial\fs30}alias Morecroft, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.50,0:33:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}化名伊文斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}alias Evans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.06,0:33:19.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}化名…\N{\fnArial\fs30}alias…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.59,0:33:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.56,0:33:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你所知的那位约翰 格拉德\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man you know as John Garrideb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.92,0:33:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾经为罗杰 普拉斯伯利工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}once worked for Roger Presbury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.70,0:33:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常奇怪 真的很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite extraordinary, it really is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.35,0:33:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away with you, get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.27,0:33:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走开 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away, get away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.24,0:33:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开路\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out of the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.24,0:33:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.20,0:33:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开 警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}be off, officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.93,0:33:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dear Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普拉斯伯利死于五年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presbury dead five years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.14,0:33:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾是格拉德的房客 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}identify Garrideb's lodger, Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.07,0:34:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.36,0:34:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 我还以为是你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, I thought it was you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.33,0:34:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这说明我的调查已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is proof he feels my boot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.47,0:34:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常接近他的阴谋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}very close to his backside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.40,0:34:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要保持这个地方整洁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be very wearisome for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.95,0:34:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一定让您很费心 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to keep this place tidy, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.67,0:34:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姐姐和我很习惯于凌乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister and I are quite used to clutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.25,0:34:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来那位约翰 格拉德是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that this John Garrideb is an impostor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.65,0:34:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫温特\N{\fnArial\fs30}his name is Winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.02,0:34:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你了 艾米丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you, Emily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.59,0:34:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不喜欢他的眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't like his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.43,0:34:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是因为骨架 亲爱的 - 他就是没有这种骨架\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was the bone structure, dear. - He simply didn't have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.56,0:34:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刚来了一封电报\N{\fnArial\fs30}A telegram arrived a moment ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.29,0:34:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 哈德森太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.57,0:34:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么夫人们 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now ladies, please, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.78,0:35:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}速来工坊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please come to workshop, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.04,0:35:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}紧急艾奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}urgent informationIkey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.60,0:35:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is very important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.10,0:35:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 关于你们美国房客的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you tell me about your American lodger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.39,0:35:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及他为什么离开你们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and why he left your household.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.52,0:35:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 他不是离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he didn't leave, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.01,0:35:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he simply disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.21,0:35:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你记得是什么时候吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember when?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.26,0:35:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时间？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.72,0:35:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.90,0:35:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四到五年之前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}four or five years ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.73,0:35:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗 艾米丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't that right, Emily?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.95,0:35:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}差个把个月吧 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give or take a few months, yes, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.95,0:35:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之后你们的哥哥占了他那间房？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your brother took over his room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.80,0:35:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道得这么清楚 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How clever of you to know that, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.74,0:35:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格拉德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Garrideb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.81,0:35:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}格拉德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Garrideb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.22,0:35:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有格拉德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Miss Garrideb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.79,0:35:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生 你能护送这两位女士回家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson, would you be good enough to escort these ladies home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.03,0:35:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有要事要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have urgent business to attend to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.84,0:35:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我随后去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll follow you later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.89,0:35:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会试着说服内森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try to persuade Nathan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.50,0:35:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要去伯明翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}not to travel to Birmingham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.27,0:35:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们十分感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be so grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.73,0:35:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那会对他的健康造成不可弥补的损害\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could cause irreparable damage to his health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.13,0:35:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打扰了 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, ladies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.56,0:35:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有幸能够见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}two of the finest detectives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.86,0:36:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位最高明的侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's ever been my privilege to meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.28,0:36:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 有趣的怪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, such a card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.37,0:36:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的非常遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am very sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.67,0:36:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}覆水难收 迈克罗夫特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's done is done, Mr. Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.65,0:36:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}范 赛德正在伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Van Seddar is in London, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.15,0:36:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他打算在明晚前\N{\fnArial\fs30}he plans to return to Amsterdam{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.90,0:36:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回阿姆斯特丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}before tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.10,0:36:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁是范 赛德？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is Van Seddar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.52,0:36:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在泰晤士河上有条船\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a boat down on the Tames, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.54,0:36:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.73,0:36:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要带…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will take…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.38,0:36:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他要带马萨林钻石去阿姆斯特丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will take the Mazarin stone to Amsterdam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.15,0:36:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定钻石还没被切割吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure the stone hasn't been cut?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.45,0:36:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}啊 是这样 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, you see, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.10,0:36:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它可以被切开\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can be cleaved, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.28,0:36:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只需一下就能切下一粒\N{\fnArial\fs30}split down the grain with a single blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.63,0:36:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普拉斯伯利的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would Presbury's assistant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.85,0:36:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}掌握了切开大钻石的工艺吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}have the necessary skill to cleave a large diamond?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.50,0:37:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别人可能会信\N{\fnArial\fs30}He may convince others that he has, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.47,0:37:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不信\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.08,0:37:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那人是个罪犯 格拉德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is a criminal, Mr. Garrideb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.83,0:37:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而他就不存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he doesn't exist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.26,0:37:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.44,0:37:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poppycock and balderdash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.25,0:37:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他就不存在 - 我们已经告诉你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He doesn't exist. - We've been trying to tell you that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.11,0:37:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不是吗 艾米丽？- 胡说 你们就是嫉妒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- haven't we, Emily? - Nonsense, you're jealous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我马上就要得到五百万美元了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm about to be handed five million dollars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.06,0:37:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没有权力劝诫您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no right to indulge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.44,0:37:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是我的专业意见 格拉德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's my professional advice, Mr. Garrideb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.98,0:37:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您不应该去伯明翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you should not travel to Birmingham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.62,0:37:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开 小沃特金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of my way, young Watkins, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.50,0:37:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除非你想被踩着\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you wish to be trampled underfoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.67,0:37:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等我明天回来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I return tomorrow, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.00,0:37:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就成了有钱人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall be a wealthy man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.30,0:37:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休斯敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医生 我姐姐和我马上就要睡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor, my sister and I will have to retire shortly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.73,0:37:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你要就寝的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have plenty of spare beds{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.43,0:37:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们这儿有很多空床 医生 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if you wish to sleep, Doctor. - No, no, please, please{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.59,0:37:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用担心我 格拉德小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't worry about me, Miss Garrideb, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.86,0:37:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就呆在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just stay there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.25,0:37:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well then, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.03,0:37:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有很多垫子\N{\fnArial\fs30}plenty of cushions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.66,0:38:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们把这些堆起来 更舒服点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's plump them up a little more comfortable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.41,0:38:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.14,0:38:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不用 别让我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no please don't let me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.75,0:38:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别因为我让你们睡不成觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't let me keep you awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.04,0:38:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把窗帘给你拉上 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just draw the curtains for you, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.09,0:38:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 不 不用 不用 这样就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, please, please, it's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.32,0:38:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随意用茶和点心 好吗 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will help yourself to tea and cake, won't you, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.31,0:38:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.33,0:38:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你想要的话 还有点雪利酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or there's a little sherry if you prefer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.72,0:38:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't hesitate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.04,0:38:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 我只要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact I might just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.48,0:38:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 艾米丽宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come along, Emily dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.27,0:38:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid you goodnight then, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.98,0:38:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.22,0:38:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都走了是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All clear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.28,0:38:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.46,0:38:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.02,0:38:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多么诡异的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}What an extraordinary room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.16,0:38:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕格拉德先生已经在去伯明翰的路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid Mr. Garrideb is on his way to Birmingham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.92,0:38:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.05,0:39:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这比我料想的更严重 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is much more serious than I thought, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.07,0:39:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may need this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.52,0:39:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}熄灭蜡烛 华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dowse the candles, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.60,0:39:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是雪利酒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that sherry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.83,0:39:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.99,0:40:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这雪利酒还不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad this sherry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.43,0:42:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你是詹姆士 温特吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Winter I presume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.63,0:42:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watson!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.41,0:42:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.71,0:42:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到他手里有枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the gun in his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.15,0:42:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.35,0:42:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找错人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the wrong man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.88,0:42:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想没有 温特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think not, Mr. Winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.87,0:42:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是普拉斯伯利的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Presbury's idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.40,0:42:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}普拉斯伯利已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presbury's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.45,0:42:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是他活着时的主意 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he was alive, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.86,0:42:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你得相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.80,0:43:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他三年里每周都去博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went to the museum every week for three years, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.11,0:43:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就为了找到偷马萨林宝石的方法 然后切割它\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the while figured out a way to steal the Mazarin stone and hack it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.04,0:43:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}复制一把钥匙很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making the duplicate key was easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.63,0:43:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他死前没有机会实施这个计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he had a chance to use it he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.81,0:43:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为那把钥匙 他被杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was murdered for that key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.24,0:43:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是我杀的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by me, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.39,0:43:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.48,0:43:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在法庭上就是这么跟陪审团说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told the jury so at the trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.01,0:43:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只是对珠宝起了争执\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was some argument over jewelry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.69,0:43:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他们不相信我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they didn't believe me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.67,0:43:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你偷了马萨林宝石吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you steal the Mazarin stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.16,0:43:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 先生 不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, I did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.58,0:43:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是故意打你的 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to hit you, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.36,0:43:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是谁干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then who did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.04,0:43:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀普拉斯伯利的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Presbury's murderer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.13,0:43:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是除我以外唯一知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only other man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.45,0:43:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}偷宝石计划的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knew of this plan to steal it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.67,0:43:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是唯一冷酷到\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the only man cool enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.77,0:43:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够从白厅偷走钻石的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take a diamond out of Whitehall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.21,0:43:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是让你遭受\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the man for whom you spent{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.99,0:43:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五年牢狱之灾的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}five years of your life behind bars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.96,0:43:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们适合在一起合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It suited us both to work together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.08,0:43:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.35,0:43:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他能偷走它\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could steal it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.59,0:44:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我可以用普拉斯伯利的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I could use Presbury's equipment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.36,0:44:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}进行快速切割\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cut it up fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.68,0:44:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但内森 格拉德碍事了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Nathan Garrideb was in the way, hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.84,0:44:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 而我是唯一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I was the only one{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.19,0:44:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道那个工坊位置的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knew the location of his workshop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.79,0:44:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 我想要来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you wonder I wanted to get to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.54,0:44:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 当我找到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can you wonder when I found this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.19,0:44:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发现这个又疯又蠢的昆虫学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}crazy boob of a bug hunter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.85,0:44:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正端坐在那上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}squatting right on top of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.75,0:44:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又从不离开自己房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And never quitting his room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.80,0:44:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我想方设法地要支走他\N{\fnArial\fs30}why I had to do all I could to shift him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.57,0:44:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老实点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.78,0:44:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干掉他要简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would've been a whole lot easier to put him away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我是个软心肠\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm a softhearted guy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.40,0:44:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像你们的拜伦勋爵所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}as your Lord Byron said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.63,0:44:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「他有着最和善的心肠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"he was the mildest mannered man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.53,0:44:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「永远不忍割开咽喉」\N{\fnArial\fs30}who ever cut a throat."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.02,0:44:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马萨林宝石在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Mazarin stone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.40,0:44:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的同伴正要把它带到这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My associate is bringing it here with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.28,0:44:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想我们得先切开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I guess now we'll have to forego cleaving it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.05,0:45:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再运到阿姆斯特丹去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before shipping it to Amsterdam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.31,0:45:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}范 赛德吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Van Seddar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.54,0:45:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.56,0:45:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它已经在去阿姆斯特丹的路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's already on its way to Amsterdam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.16,0:45:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的同伙背叛了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your associate has betrayed you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.21,0:45:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像他之前背叛别人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just as he's betrayed so many others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.44,0:45:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和他有约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}He and I made a deal, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.37,0:45:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而君子一向遵守诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a gentleman always keeps his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.77,0:45:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上路吧 范 赛德\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more charm, Van Seddar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.02,0:45:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 别 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, please, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.92,0:45:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该给你找个医生吗 医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I get a doctor, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.42,0:45:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不 给我条毛巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, just get me a towel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.48,0:46:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有水就行 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}and some water, please, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.70,0:46:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的同伙利用了你 温特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your associate has used you, Winter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.74,0:46:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他本来就没打算让你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had no intention of allowing you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.45,0:46:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}切割钻石\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cleave the stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.03,0:46:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你已经完成了你的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd served your purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.02,0:46:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 范 赛德的船在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, where is Van Seddar's boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.21,0:51:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brother mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.94,0:51:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo.{\r}
